WEBVTT

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.967
Hi, I'm Ian Slade.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.045
My journey began as a
clinician at the bedside,

00:00:05.085 --> 00:00:06.886
where I learned that
the latest technology

00:00:06.926 --> 00:00:08.883
works best in caring hands.

00:00:09.307 --> 00:00:12.115
For more than twenty years,
I've worked to put it there.

00:00:12.155 --> 00:00:14.001
I've been a
technology consultant,

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:17.280
a speaker, an author
and a policy advocate,

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.187
but the driver
has never changed:

00:00:19.476 --> 00:00:22.151
technology for the
well-being of humanity.

00:00:22.485 --> 00:00:25.205
It's why I built Hannah,
why I tell stories,

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:28.708
and why I work to make
technology useful and safe.

00:00:29.177 --> 00:00:31.763
If that matters to you too,
let's talk.
